#. front matter: title
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:2
msgid "GitHubでリポジトリを作成する"
msgstr "Create a Repository on GitHub"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:11
msgid ""
"GitHubでリポジトリを作成する手順は非常にシンプルです。以下に、具体的な手順を"
"説明します。"
msgstr ""
"Creating a repository on GitHub is a very simple process. Below are the "
"specific steps."

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:13
msgid "リポジトリ作成ページを開く"
msgstr "Open the Repository Creation Page"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:15
msgid "[GitHub](https://github.com/)にアクセスし、アカウントにログインします。"
msgstr "Go to [GitHub](https://github.com/) and log in to your account."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:17
msgid "![GitHubのメニュー](images/github-new-repository.webp)"
msgstr "![GitHub Menu](images/github-new-repository.webp)"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:19
msgid ""
"トップページの右上にある「+」アイコンをクリックし、ドロップダウンメニューから"
"「New repository」を選択します。"
msgstr ""
"Click the \"+\" icon in the top-right corner of the homepage, and select "
"\"New repository\" from the dropdown menu."

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:21
msgid "リポジトリの基本情報を入力"
msgstr "Enter the Basic Information for the Repository"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:23
msgid "リポジトリの所有者、名前、説明を入力します。"
msgstr "Enter the repository owner, name, and description."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:25
msgid "![リポジトリの基本設定](images/github-repository-basic-settings.webp)"
msgstr ""
"![Repository Basic Settings](images/github-repository-basic-settings.webp)"

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:27
msgid ""
"Owner  \n"
"リポジトリを所有するアカウントや組織を選びます。  \n"
"自分の個人アカウントか、組織アカウントのどちらかを選択します。"
msgstr ""
"Owner  \n"
"Select the account or organization that will own the repository.  \n"
"You can choose either your personal account or an organization account."

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:30
msgid ""
"Repository name  \n"
"リポジトリの名前を入力します。"
msgstr ""
"Repository name  \n"
"Enter the name of the repository."

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:32
msgid ""
"Description  \n"
"リポジトリの説明を入力します。"
msgstr ""
"Description  \n"
"Enter a description of the repository."

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:35
msgid "可視性の設定"
msgstr "Set Repository Visibility"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:37
msgid "リポジトリの可視性を設定します。"
msgstr "Set the visibility of the repository."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:39
msgid ""
"![リポジトリの可視性設定](images/github-repository-visibility-setting.webp)"
msgstr ""
"![Repository Visibility Settings](images/github-repository-visibility-"
"setting.webp)"

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:41
msgid ""
"Public  \n"
"リポジトリを公開して、誰でも閲覧できるようにします。"
msgstr ""
"Public  \n"
"Make the repository public, allowing anyone to view it."

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:43
msgid ""
"Private  \n"
"リポジトリを非公開にして、自分や招待されたメンバーのみがアクセスできるように"
"します。"
msgstr ""
"Private  \n"
"Make the repository private, so only you and invited members can access it."

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:46
msgid "README / .gitignore / LICENSEの追加"
msgstr "Add README / .gitignore / LICENSE"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:48
msgid ""
"リポジトリにREADME、.gitignore、LICENSEなどの基本となるファイルの追加を行いま"
"す。"
msgstr ""
"Add essential files like README, .gitignore, or LICENSE to the repository."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:50
msgid ""
"![リポジトリの初期ファイル設定](images/github-repository-initial-file-"
"settings.webp)"
msgstr ""
"![Initial File Settings](images/github-repository-initial-file-settings.webp)"

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:52
msgid ""
"Add a README file  \n"
"このチェックボックスをオンにすると、リポジトリにREADME.mdファイルが自動で作成"
"されます。  \n"
"README.mdファイルは、リポジトリの概要や使用方法を記述する場所です。"
msgstr ""
"Add a README file  \n"
"If you check this box, a README.md file will be automatically created in the "
"repository.  \n"
"The README.md file is where you can describe the overview and usage of the "
"repository."

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:55
msgid ""
"Add .gitignore  \n"
"プログラミング言語やフレームワークを選択し、不要なファイルやフォルダをGitに追"
"跡させないための.gitignoreファイルを追加できます。  \n"
"これにより、特定のファイルやディレクトリがリポジトリにコミットされないように"
"設定できます。"
msgstr ""
"Add .gitignore  \n"
"You can select a programming language or framework and add a .gitignore file "
"to exclude unnecessary files or folders from being tracked by Git.  \n"
"This allows you to configure specific files or directories that won’t be "
"committed to the repository."

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:58
msgid ""
"Choose a license  \n"
"どのライセンスで公開するかを選択できます。  \n"
"リポジトリのライセンスは、他の人がどのようにコードを使用できるかを決めます。"
msgstr ""
"Choose a license  \n"
"You can choose which license to release the repository under.  \n"
"The repository license determines how others can use the code."

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:62
msgid "リポジトリを作成する"
msgstr "Create the Repository"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:64
msgid ""
"すべての設定が完了したら、ページ下部にある「Create repository」ボタンをクリッ"
"クします。"
msgstr ""
"Once all the settings are complete, click the \"Create repository\" button "
"at the bottom of the page."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/create-github-repository/index.md:66
msgid ""
"これによりリポジトリが作成され、リポジトリのメインページが表示されます。ここ"
"から、ローカルにクローンしたり、ファイルを追加したり、リポジトリの管理が行え"
"ます。"
msgstr ""
"This will create the repository, and the repository's main page will be "
"displayed. From here, you can clone it locally, add files, and manage the "
"repository."
